                  "TicketDescription": "Valid on West Midlands Railway and London Northwestern Railway services only.",
                  "TicketRestriction": "<p>Not valid for travel on services timed to <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">arrive</span></strong> London Terminals before 13:00.</p>\nNot valid for travel on northbound services timed to <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">depart</span></strong> any station before 10:30.\n<p> </p>\n<p>Not valid for travel on services timed to <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">depart</span></strong> the\norigin station on the ticket after 15:59 and before 19:01 in either\ndirection.</p>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"tablepara\">A connecting service can be used to complete a journey begun at a valid time.</p>",
